  "title": "packaging: Debian: Don't depend on libcpuinfo on unsupported arch",
  "description": "Debian/Ubuntu build the libcpuinfo-dev package for unsupported\narchitectures. Unfortunately the package is built so that the\nlibrary prints error messages for unsupported architectures instead\nreturning an error code / error string and letting the calling\nexecutable handle it.\n\nDon't depend on it on those architectures.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
